{"id": "t155-006", "text": "Need to buy a card for Jen's baby shower on May 14. She said they're doing a woodland theme.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy a card for Jen's baby shower", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby shower", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-010", "text": "Joy said the gender reveal is off. They decided it felt too much like a performance, so they're just going to announce it at Christmas instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "announce it", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t155-012", "text": "Finn's partner Sophie gave birth on October 12th! A girl, 3.2 kg, called Ivy. Finn sounded absolutely exhausted but over the moon. They're home now and Sophie's mum is staying with them for the first fortnight. Finn goes back to work on November 2nd and is already dreading it. Remind me to send a meal delivery voucher the week after he goes back, when things will be hardest.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gave birth", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "October 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girl", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "3.2 kg", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivy", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "goes back to work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a meal delivery voucher", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after he goes back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-013", "text": "I should send something to Karim the week after the baby arrives. He mentioned they're short on muslins and bibs.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something to Karim", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby arrives", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "short on muslins and bibs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t155-014", "text": "Ali's rabbit Clover had to be put to sleep this morning. He's really cut up about it. Remind me to check in with him that evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rabbit Clover", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "put to sleep", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cut up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-015", "text": "Emily is expecting twins! Due date is June 3rd, but the midwife said twins usually come early. She's nervous about the birth and about how they'll manage with two. Her husband has asked for extended leave but hasn't heard back from his boss yet. She's set up the cots already and showed me photos of the nursery, all pale green with little foxes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting twins", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "midwife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "extended leave", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "r2"}]}
{"id": "t155-017", "text": "Eduardo loves birdwatching and has been trying to spot a kingfisher all summer. Might be a nice gift idea, a decent pair of binoculars.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eduardo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "birdwatching", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to spot a kingfisher", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "all summer"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gift idea, a decent pair of binoculars", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t155-018", "text": "Lin's christening is March 2027 because they want her grandparents to be able to fly over from Taipei. Remind me to book the hotel the week before. Her husband Thomas is handling the church side and says there'll be a lunch afterwards at his parents' house. Lin wants me to do a reading, which I'm honoured by but also slightly terrified about.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandparents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the hotel", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t155-023", "text": "Sadia's baby boy arrived early, on 9/28. Both doing well. They're calling him Yusuf.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "baby boy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "arrived", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/28", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t155-024", "text": "Remind me to drop off the casserole for Georgia the day after she gets home from hospital. She's had a rough recovery after the C-section. She's been in for five days because of an infection. Her mum is looking after the older two in the meantime, and their dog Hector has gone to a neighbour. She said she's fed up of hospital food more than anything.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off the casserole for Georgia", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gets home from hospital", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "C-section", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "five days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the meantime"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Hector", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up of hospital food", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t155-027", "text": "Mandla is godfather to his best friend's son. The christening was meant to be May 14 but they've pushed it back to June 3rd because the vicar's ill.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "godfather", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "best friend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "to June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t155-028", "text": "Jen mentioned she'd love a proper baby carrier, the ergonomic kind. Possible gift for after the birth.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a proper baby carrier, the ergonomic kind", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birth", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t155-029", "text": "Oliver and Mai have been trying for a baby for nearly two years. They're starting IVF in the new year. Don't bring it up unless she does. Mai said the waiting and the injections are the hardest part, and Oliver is trying to stay positive for both of them. First appointment is January 8th. I should send her something small that week, just so she knows I'm thinking of her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying for a baby", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearly two years"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "IVF", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to stay positive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "First appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "January 8th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something small", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t155-030", "text": "Must ring Pieter the morning of his wife's induction. It's booked for 11/3 at the Royal.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Pieter", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "induction", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/3", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t155-031", "text": "Valentina is fostering kittens for the local shelter again. Four this time, all ginger.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fostering kittens for the local shelter", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t155-038", "text": "Ali and his husband are expecting via surrogacy. Baby due 2 November 2026. They've asked me to be a guardian, which I need to think about properly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting via surrogacy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "think about properly", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t155-044", "text": "Milan's cat Smudge got hit by a car on Friday night. She survived but needs an operation on her back leg. He sounded shaken. The operation is booked for Wednesday at the emergency vet in town and will cost a fortune. His girlfriend Aisha is starting a fundraiser among friends. Remind me to chip in and to message him the day after the surgery to see how Smudge is doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Smudge", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hit by a car", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "shaken", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fundraiser", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "chip in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after the surgery", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t155-045", "text": "Thomas mentioned he and his partner had a miscarriage in the summer. He's doing okay now but it's been a hard year for them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thomas", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "miscarriage", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t155-049", "text": "Meera's grandmother is turning ninety-five in March 2027. The whole family is flying in from Mumbai. Meera's in charge of the cake and slightly panicking. She's thinking of doing three tiers with marigolds on top. Her brother Milan is sorting flights for their aunties and says it's a full time job. The party is the Saturday after the birthday itself.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning ninety-five", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Mumbai", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly panicking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunties", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after the birthday itself", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t155-050", "text": "Erin's baby shower is cancelled because she's on bed rest. She's fine, just being careful. I should drop round with snacks and magazines.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Erin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bed rest", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round with snacks and magazines", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t155-054", "text": "Gemma's due date is 6/3 and her bump is huge already. She's craving pickles and grapefruit, which she finds hilarious. Her husband Ethan is painting the nursery this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due date", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6/3", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "craving pickles and grapefruit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "painting the nursery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t155-055", "text": "Pieter's son had his first birthday on Saturday. Big party, far too many balloons. I left early to beat traffic.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pieter", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first birthday", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t155-057", "text": "Mai's twins are due 5/14, but she's booked in for a C-section the week before. Remind me to send flowers the day after. She's had a rough third trimester with terrible heartburn and swollen ankles, and she's been signed off work since September. Her mum is moving in for the first month, which Mai has mixed feelings about.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "C-section", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "heartburn", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "swollen ankles", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "signed off work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "since September"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving in", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first month", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "mixed feelings", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t155-059", "text": "Valentina and her partner are naming the baby Rosa after her great-aunt. Christening probably in spring, no date yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosa", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "great-aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably in spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
